{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03558","headline":"宝劒篇 · 李峤","name":"宝劒篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴山开，越溪涸，三金合冶成宝锷。\n淬绿水，鉴红云，五采焰起光氛氲。\n背上铭爲万年字，胸前点作七星文。\n龟甲参差白虹色，辘轳宛转黄金饰。\n骇犀中断宁方利，骏马羣騑未拟直。\n风霜凛凛匣上清，精气遥遥斗间明。\n避灾朝穿晋帝屋，逃乱夜入楚王城。\n一朝运偶逢大仙，虎吼龙鸣腾上天。\n东皇提昇紫微座，西皇佩下赤城田。\n承平久息干戈事，侥幸得充文武备。\n除灾辟患宜君王，益寿延龄後天地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03558.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03558","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}